037e"],"facts":[{"id":"santizhu-f-sr-003","text":"曲阿人，弘咨之孙，权外甥；后至中书令、太子少傅（张俨出使同行之五官中郎将）","evidence":["santizhu-q-a843afcbffd7f04f037e"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o185-shaodi-p0161","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o185"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-1abe36553002eacb14bf","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-1b3ba084dde8a42ed023","layer":"original","quote":"甘露元年三月，皓遣使，随绍、彧报书曰：“知以高世之才，处宰辅之任；渐导之功〖1〗，勤亦至矣。孤以不德，阶承统绪；思与贤良，共济世道；而以壅隔，未有所缘。嘉意允著〖2〗，深用依依〖3〗。今遣光禄大夫纪陟、五官中郎将弘璆，宣明至怀","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":326,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-8aafa3f3bb101a75e9ae","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-5b25237441df81b49150","layer":"original","quote":"遇晋文帝崩","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-956f17a5b344a3eb7e31","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-5b25237441df81b49150","layer":"original","quote":"陟、璆至洛","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-a843afcbffd7f04f037e","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-abd9227fad0e4bb54dc2","layer":"pei","quote":"弘璆，曲阿人。弘咨之孙，权外甥也。璆后至中书令、太子少傅。”","attribution":"裴注（引书未明）","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e27b22ad0ec8aa70587","start":56,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e37418d015bc216df881","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-5b25237441df81b49150","layer":"original","quote":"十一月，乃遣还","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o185b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-acdd751b1e1832635818","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，南深泽县言甘露降〖4〗。吴遣使纪陟、弘璆请和〖5〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o184","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-1096c71775017a1a0d00","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，甲辰〖1〗，朐顗县获灵龟以献〖2〗，归之于相国府。庚戌〖3〗，以虎贲张修，昔于成都驰马至诸营，言钟会反逆，以至没身；赐修弟倚，爵关内侯。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o185","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-acdd751b1e1832635818","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，南深泽县言甘露降〖4〗。吴遣使纪陟、弘璆请和〖5〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
